{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>ומני</b> — its meaning is like <b>שגגה</b> (inadvertent error). And like it: <b>על השל</b>." "<b>כל</b> — for deliverance, like <b>כאלהים הזה</b> (like this Elohim)."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The Aramaic phrase על השל is cited without context; rendered hyper-literally as it stands.", 1 "The phrase כדנא כאלהים הזה appears to cite the Aramaic of Daniel 3:29 directly; rendered as quoted."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:42.858477215Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}